eduction in cash usage and increased online activity have resulted in new innovative tools and processes. The financial payments chain is also growing increasingly dynamic and fragmented, with increased diversity in service providers offering payment and transaction services (see also section 3.1 below). who exploit these opportunities to drastically improve their ML techn"}, {"id": "fatf_cyber_fraud_2023#p07-1-1-focus-and-scope", "section": "1.1. Focus and scope", "text": "3. This report focuses on illicit financing arising from fraud that is enabled through or conducted in the cyber environment and that (i) involves transnational criminality such as transnational actors and funds flows and (ii) involves deceptive social engineering techniques (i.e., manipulating victims to obtain access to confidential or personal information). Recognising the many variations of such fraud, this report focuses on the following types of criminal activity (referred to collectively "}], "similar_prior_cases": [{"distance": 0.276069, "exposure_usd": 0, "id": "CC-3931", "kind": "closed", "opened_at": "2016-09-25 07:08:38", "outcome_or_verdict": "cleared", "overlap_reasons": ["same_region"], "pattern": "none"}, {"distance": 0.3077241, "exposure_usd": 359.99, "id": "CC-5530", "kind": "closed", "opened_at": "2016-10-31 18:43:46", "outcome_or_verdict": "confirmed_fraud", "overlap_reasons": ["same_region"], "pattern": "account_takeover"}, {"distance": 0.316779, "exposure_usd": 215.9, "id": "CC-4347", "kind": "closed", "opened_at": "2016-10-04 08:08:40", "outcome_or_verdict": "confirmed_fraud", "overlap_reasons": ["same_region"], "pattern": "out_of_region_use"}, {"distance": 0.316779, "exposure_usd": 17.91, "id": "CC-5316", "kind": "closed", "opened_at": "2016-10-26 16:54:59", "outcome_or_verdict": "confirmed_fraud", "overlap_reasons": ["same_region"], "pattern": "out_of_region_use"}, {"distance": 0.3327301, "exposure_usd": 25.9, "id": "CC-5034", "kind": "closed", "opened_at": "2016-10-19 18